---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav";
---

<Layout
  title="About QueryLock — Security Through Education"
  description="QueryLock helps people understand cybersecurity before it becomes a problem through practical guides and tailored team training."
>
  <Nav active="about" client:load />
  <main class="">
    <section class="about-story section section-lg">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-story-content mb-8">
          <span class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span>About QueryLock</span>
          <h1>Security Through <span class="gradient-text">Education</span></h1>
          <div class="about-story-text">
            <p>
              QueryLock is a cybersecurity education company built on one idea: <strong>a safer internet starts with educated people, not just better tools.</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
              Most security problems are not tool problems. They are knowledge problems. Our founder spent years as a penetration tester watching the same findings return year after year. The cause was rarely a lack of tools. Developers were expected to write secure code without ever being taught how. Cybersecurity courses covered frameworks and tooling while often skipping remediation and secure code review. Everyday people were asked to trust safeguards like multi-factor authentication without understanding why they mattered.
            </p>
            <p>
              Security tools reveal problems. Education prevents them. Developers who understand why vulnerabilities exist are less likely to create them. People who understand why safeguards exist are less likely to ignore them.
            </p>
            <p>
              That belief shapes everything we make. Our guides make cybersecurity approachable by helping readers go from no prior knowledge to confidently discussing technical topics. Our training gives teams practical knowledge they can understand, apply, and retain so the learning outlasts the session.
            </p>
            <p>
              When developers build with security in mind and everyday people understand the safeguards around them, the internet gets safer for everyone. We are not trying to be the loudest name in security. We are trying to be the one that finally makes it make sense.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-cta-buttons">
            <a href="https://shop.querylock.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Explore the Guides</a>
            <a href="https://shop.querylock.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline btn-lg"
              >Schedule Training</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-story {
    background: var(--ql-white);
  }

  .about-story-content {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .about-story-content h1 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .about-story-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--ql-violet);
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  .about-story-text p {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.5vw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--fg-2);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
</style>
